WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
11:00 — Sunday plan. Sunday laptop meal plan — five dinners that survive an 8pm arrival, not a fantasy chef schedule.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
18:30 — Phone cook. Phone recipe on the counter while he cooks; steps big enough to read with wet hands.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
19:40 — iPad shop. iPad shopping list on the walk to the shop; Tuesday still has a dinner because the list existed.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
20:30 — Laptop tweak. Laptop tweak for next week — swap one night, keep the spine of the plan intact.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:00 — Phone. Phone tomorrow reminder. Takeaway is a choice now, not the default.

